#: Views/ContentMenuItemPart.Edit.cshtml
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Menu.Views.ContentMenuItemPart.Edit"
msgid ""
"When enabled, we will verify the user's permission to view content items "
"before displaying them in the menu. This process may negatively impact "
"performance, so it is highly recommended to cache the menu when this option "
"is activated."
msgstr "启用后，我们会在菜单中显示内容项之前验证用户查看内容项的权限。此过程可能会对性能产生负面影响，因此强烈建议在启用此选项时缓存菜单。"

